Given todo (A parked stub carrying a due date):
  (B) Pay the internet due:2026-10-05
  Inbox note
  (P) Water the flowers +garden due:2026-10-01 every:1m rid:b2c3
  x 2026-09-01 Old done task
Execute (SortDue re-parks the stub):
  " due: is an ordinary tag a stub can carry, and the due sort sends the line
  " wherever its date ranks. Parking must undo that, as every other sort does.
  call todo#SortDue()
Expect todo (The stub is back at the tail of the active tasks):
  (B) Pay the internet due:2026-10-05
  Inbox note
  (P) Water the flowers +garden due:2026-10-01 every:1m rid:b2c3
  x 2026-09-01 Old done task


