  (P) Water the flowers +home every:1w last:2026-09-01 rid:c3d4

Given todo (A repeat stub that lost its rid):
  (A) Control the repair
  (P) Pay the internet every:1m last:2026-08-01
  x 2026-09-01 Old done task
Execute (Untracked it cannot be guarded, so it never spawns):
  " Before the fix every pass spawned another copy: the stub survived with its
  " old last: and nothing recorded an open instance.
  AssertEqual 0, todo#MaterializeStubs()
  AssertEqual 0, todo#MaterializeStubs()
  AssertEqual 0, todo#MaterializeStubs()
Expect todo (Untouched, pass after pass):
