  (P) Pay the internet again every:1m last:2026-08-01 rid:a1b2
  x 2026-09-01 Old done task
Execute (One rid, one instance per pass):
  " Both stubs are due and the buffer is only rewritten at the end of the
  " scan, so the pass itself has to remember the rid it just spawned.
  AssertEqual 1, todo#MaterializeStubs()
  AssertEqual 0, todo#MaterializeStubs()
  call ReplaceCurrentDates('')
Expect todo (The first stub in buffer order wins):
  (B) **TODAY** Pay the internet rid:a1b2
  (P) Pay the internet every:1m last:2026-08-01 rid:a1b2
  (P) Pay the internet again every:1m last:2026-08-01 rid:a1b2
  x 2026-09-01 Old done task

