  (P) Pay the internet +home every:1m rid:a1b2
Execute (Cancelling stamps last: too, the series stays alive):
  " On purpose: without last: there is nothing to count the period from, so
  " cancelling the first instance would kill the series silently.
  :1,1global/^./call todo#ToggleMarkAsDone('Cancelled')
  :Assert todo#StubDue(getline(2), todo#DateStringAdd(strftime('%Y-%m-%d'), 1, 'm'))
  :Assert !todo#StubDue(getline(2), strftime('%Y-%m-%d'))
  :call ReplaceCurrentDates('')
