  (P) Pay the internet +home every:1m rid:a1b2
Execute (The countdown starts at the completion):
  :1,1global/^./call todo#MarkAsDone('')
  :AssertEqual 0, todo#MaterializeStubs()
  :call ReplaceCurrentDates('')
