  2026-09-01 (P) Book a dentist show:2026-10-14
Execute (The priority mappings are there):
  AssertEqual ':call todo#PrioritizeIncrease()<CR>', maparg('\j', 'n')
  AssertEqual ':call todo#PrioritizeDecrease()<CR>', maparg('\k', 'n')
Do (Raise and lower the priority of both stubs):
