Given todo (A stub and a plain note):
  (P) Pay the internet +home every:1m rid:a1b2
  A plain inbox note
Execute (The add-priority mappings are there):
  AssertEqual ':call todo#PrioritizeAdd(''A'')<CR>', maparg('\a', 'n')
  AssertEqual ':call todo#PrioritizeAdd(''B'')<CR>', maparg('\b', 'n')
  AssertEqual ':call todo#PrioritizeAdd(''C'')<CR>', maparg('\c', 'n')
Execute (Add-priority leaves the stub alone):
